<h5 class="heading-size-5" id="alliance">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_alliance.gif");'></span>
<span class="q3">Alliance</span></h5>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="human">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_human_female.gif");'></span>Human</h4>
<div class="box">
<ul class="first last">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20599/diplomacy">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_note_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Diplomacy</span></a>: Reputation gains increased by 10%.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=58985/perception">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_sleep.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Perception</span></a>: Increases your Stealth detection..</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20864/mace-specialization">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hammer_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mace Specialization</span></a>: Expertise with Maces and Two-Handed Maces increased by 3.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20597/sword-specialization">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_meleedamage.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sword Specialization</span></a>: Expertise with Swords and Two-Handed Swords increased by 3.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20598/the-human-spirit">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_shardbrilliantsmall.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Human Spirit</span></a>: Spirit increased by 3%.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=59752/will-to-survive">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_charm.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Will to Survive</span></a>: Removes all movement impairing effects and all effects which cause loss of control of your character. This effect shares a cooldown with other similar effects.</div></li></ul></div>Human is a decent option for Blood Death Knight DPS, the extra expertise gained from <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20864/mace-specialization">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hammer_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mace Specialization</span></a> and <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20597/sword-specialization">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_meleedamage.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sword Specialization</span></a> when using those weapon types might not heavily influence how you gear, but any benefit is better than none. Maces aren't really shining as the expansion goes on, but there is a great sword option. It's also the best option if you pvp at all due to <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=59752/will-to-survive">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_charm.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Will to Survive</span></a>.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="dwarf">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_dwarf_female.gif");'></span>Dwarf</h4>
<div class="box">
<ul class="first last">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=2481/find-treasure">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/racial_dwarf_findtreasure.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Find Treasure</span></a>: Allows the dwarf to sense nearby treasure, making it appear on the minimap.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20596/frost-resistance">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_frost_wizardmark.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Frost Resistance</span></a>: Chance to be hit by frost spells reduced by 2%.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20595/gun-specialization">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_musket_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gun Specialization</span></a>: Your chance to critically hit with Guns is increased by 1%.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20594/stoneform">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_unholystrength.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stoneform</span></a>: While active, grants immunity to Bleed, Poison, and Disease effects. In addition, Armor increased by 10%. Lasts 8 sec.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=59224/mace-specialization">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hammer_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mace Specialization</span></a>: Expertise with Maces and Two-Hnaded Maces increased by 5.</div></li></ul></div>Dwarf now provides some Expertise through <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=59224/mace-specialization">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hammer_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mace Specialization</span></a> being added in Wrath. While there are Mace options, they won't be your BIS so this feels ultimately useless.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="night-elf">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_nightelf_female.gif");'></span>Night Elf</h4>
<div class="box">
<ul class="first last">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20583/nature-resistance">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_spiritarmor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nature Resistance</span></a>: Chance to be hit by nature spells reduced by 2%.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20585/wisp-spirit">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_wispsplode.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wisp Spirit</span></a>: Transform into a wisp upon death, increasing movement speed by 75%.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20582/quickness">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_racial_shadowmeld.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Quickness</span></a>: Chance to be hit reduced by 2%.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=58984/shadowmeld">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_ambush.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shadowmeld</span></a>: Activate to slip into the shadows, reducing the chance for enemies to detect your presence. Lasts until cancelled or upon moving. Any threat is restored versus enemies still in combat upon cancellation of this effect.</div></li></ul></div>Night Elf provides no DPS benefit.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="draenei">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_draenei_female.gif");'></span>Draenei</h4>
<div class="box">
<ul class="first last">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=28875/gemcutting">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_misc_conjuremanajewel.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gemcutting</span></a>: Jewelcrafting skill increased by 5.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=28880/gift-of-the-naaru">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_holyprotection.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gift of the Naaru</span></a>: Heals the target over 15 sec.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=6562/heroic-presence">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_21.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heroic Presence</span></a>: Increases chance to hit by 1% for you and all party members within 30 yards.</div></li></ul></div>Draenei is a strong contender for best Death Knight race for the Alliance, assuming you don't already have an abundance of Draenai's in the raid. If you have one in your party in raid already, then this racial is useless. While Wrath sees a lot of abilities go raid wide, <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=6562/heroic-presence">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_21.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heroic Presence</span></a> is still a party buff.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="gnome">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_gnome_female.gif");'></span>Gnome</h4>
<div class="box">
<ul class="first last">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20592/arcane-resistance">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_wispsplode.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcane Resistance</span></a>: Chance to be hit by arcane spells reduced by 2%</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20591/expansive-mind">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_essenceeternallarge.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Expansive Mind</span></a>: Intelligence increased by 5%.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20593/engineering-specialization">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gear_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering Specialization</span></a>: Engineering skill increased by 15.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20589/escape-artist">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_rogue_trip.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Escape Artist</span></a>: Escape the effects of any immobilization or movement speed reduction effect.</div></li></ul></div>Gnome provides no DPS benefit.<h5 class="heading-size-5" id="horde">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_horde.gif");'></span>
<span class="q10">Horde</span></h5>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="orc">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_orc_female.gif");'></span>Orc</h4>
<div class="box">
<ul class="first last">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20574/axe-specialization">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Axe Specialization</span></a> - Expertise with Axes and Two-Handed Axes increased by 5.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20573/hardiness">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hardiness</span></a> - Duration of stuns reduced by 15%.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20575/command">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_warcry.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Command</span></a> - Damage dealt by pets increased by 5%.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20572/blood-fury">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/racial_orc_berserkerstrength.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blood Fury</span></a> - Increases attack power for 15 sec.</div></li></ul></div>Orcs are a solid option for Blood Death Knight DPS players. With your Best in Slot weapon from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a> and <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a> both being axes, the expertise from <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20574/axe-specialization">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Axe Specialization</span></a> is more than enough to justify rolling Orc.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="troll">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_troll_female.gif");'></span>Troll</h4>
<div class="box">
<ul class="first last">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20557/beast-slaying">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_pelt_bear_ruin_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Beast Slaying</span></a>: Damage dealt versus Beasts increased by 5%.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=26297/berserking">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/racial_troll_berserk.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Berserking</span></a>: Increases your attack and casting speed by 20% Lasts 10 sec.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=26290/bow-specialization">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_bow_12.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bow Specialization</span></a>: Your chance to critically hit with Bows is increased by 1%.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20555/regeneration">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_regenerate.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Regeneration</span></a>: Health regeneration rate increased by 10%.  10% of total Health regeneration may continue during combat.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20558/throwing-specialization">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_throwingaxe_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Throwing Specialization</span></a>: Your chance to critically hit with Throwing Weapons is increased by 1%.</div></li></ul></div>Troll also proves to be a solid option for Blood Death Knight DPS players. With <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=49028/dancing-rune-weapon">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_07.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dancing Rune Weapon</span></a> snapshotting similarly to how <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=49206/summon-gargoyle">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_hunter_pet_bat.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Summon Gargoyle</span></a> did previously, <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=26297/berserking">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/racial_troll_berserk.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Berserking</span></a> will lead to better <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=49028/dancing-rune-weapon">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_07.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dancing Rune Weapon</span></a> windows.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="tauren">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_tauren_female.gif");'></span>Tauren</h4>
<div class="box">
<ul class="first last">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20552/cultivation">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_flower_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cultivation</span></a>: Herbalism skill increased by 15.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20550/endurance">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_unyeildingstamina.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Endurance</span></a>: Base Health increased by 5%.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20551/nature-resistance">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_spiritarmor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nature Resistance</span></a>: Chance to be hit by nature spells reduced by 2%</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20549/war-stomp">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warstomp.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">War Stomp</span></a>: Stuns up to 5 enemies within 8 yds for 2 sec.</div></li></ul></div>Tauren provides no DPS benefit.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="blood-elf">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_bloodelf_female.gif");'></span>Blood Elf</h4>
<div class="box">
<ul class="first last">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=28877/arcane-affinity">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_shardglimmeringlarge.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcane Affinity</span></a>: Enchanting skill increased by 10.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=822/magic-resistance">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_antimagicshell.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Magic Resistance</span></a>: Chance to be hit by all spells reduced by 2%.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=50613/arcane-torrent">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_teleport.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcane Torrent</span></a>: Silence all enemies within 8 yards for 2 sec and restores 15 Runic Power. Non-player victim spellcasting is also interrupted for 3 sec.</div></li></ul></div>Blood Elfs provide no DPS benefit.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="undead">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_scourge_female.gif");'></span>Undead</h4>
<div class="box">
<ul class="first last">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20577/cannibalize">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_racial_cannibalize.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cannibalize</span></a>: When activated, regenerates 7% of total health every 2 sec for 10 sec.  Only works on Humanoid or Undead corpses within 5 yds.  Any movement, action, or damage taken while Cannibalizing will cancel the effect.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20579/shadow-resistance">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_detectinvisibility.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shadow Resistance</span></a>: Chance to be hit by shadow spells reduced by 2%</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=5227/underwater-breathing">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_demonbreath.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Underwater Breathing</span></a>: Underwater breath lasts 233% longer than normal.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=7744/will-of-the-forsaken">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_raisedead.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Will of the Forsaken</span></a>: Removes any Charm, Fear and Sleep effect. This effect shares a 45 sec cooldown with other similar effects.</div></li></ul></div>Undead provides no DPS benefit.<div class="pad"></div>
<hr/>
<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-professions">
<span class="c6">Best Professions for Blood Death Knight DPS in Wrath of the Lich King</span></h2>The best professions for Blood DPS is currently Jewelcrafting and Engineering. Blacksmithing might overtake Jewelcrafting once Epic gems are out, but there's still some testing that needs to be done on this.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="talent-builds">
<span class="c6">Talent Builds for Blood Death Knight DPS in Wrath of the Lich King</span></h2>There's two builds that come out a head depending on the situation, Morbidity Blood and Night of the Blood.<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="morbidity-blood">51/<wbr/>0/<wbr/>20 Blood Death Knight DPS Talent Build</h3>
