<del></del>
<a aria-label="Icon" href="javascript:"></a></div>
<span>Glyph of Blood Tap</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="pad"></div>
<div class="pad"></div>This build is your Single Target bread and butter build. The reduced cooldown of <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=46584/raise-dead">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_animatedead.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Raise Dead</span></a> will allow you to line it up with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=49028/dancing-rune-weapon">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_07.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dancing Rune Weapon</span></a> windows, and the 90% reduction of AOE damage ensures it lives through most abilities.<div class="pad"></div>
<div class="pad"></div>You'll notice that each build has <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=43827/glyph-of-death-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glyph_majordeathknight.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Glyph of Death Strike</span></a>. It's worth noting that this is great for for Single Target fights, but <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=43546/glyph-of-icy-touch">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glyph_majordeathknight.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Glyph of Icy Touch</span></a> comes ahead of it for longer Cleave fights and AOE.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">
<span class="c6">Best in Slot gear for Blood Death Knight DPS in Wrath of the Lich King</span></h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="pre-raid">Pre-Raid Blood Death Knight DPS Gear</h3>
