<br/>Most of this gear will not be available for pre-raid until P3, as <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=2589/sidereal-essence">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_icediamond_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sidereal Essence</span></span></a> becomes a new currency introduced. Currently you earn 1 per Heroic+ dungeon cleared.<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="ulduar-bis">Ulduar BIS Blood Death Knight DPS Gear</h3>
