<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="ability-usage">Ability usage for Blood Death Knight DPS</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="opener">Opener Blood Death Knight DPS</h3>There are 3 openers currently out there for Blood, we're only going to cover the basic non-double disease opener. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=42650/army-of-the-dead">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_deathknight_armyofthedead.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Army of the Dead</span></a> 6 seconds before pull &gt; <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40211/potion-of-speed">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_alchemy_elixir_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Potion of Speed</span></a> 1 second before pull &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=49016/unholy-frenzy">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_deathknight_bladedarmor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unholy Frenzy</span></a> + Racial (If you have one) + <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=54999/hyperspeed-accelerators">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hyperspeed Accelerators</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=49909/icy-touch">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_deathknight_icetouch.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Icy Touch</span></a>  &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=49921/plague-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_deathknight_empowerruneblade.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Plague Strike</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=49924/death-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_deathknight_butcher2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death Strike</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55262/heart-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart Strike</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55262/heart-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart Strike</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47568/empower-rune-weapon">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_62.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Empower Rune Weapon</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=46584/raise-dead">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_animatedead.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Raise Dead</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=49028/dancing-rune-weapon">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_07.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dancing Rune Weapon</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=49924/death-strike">
