<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart Strike</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55262/heart-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart Strike</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55262/heart-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart Strike</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55262/heart-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart Strike</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55262/heart-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart Strike</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=50842/pestilence">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_plaguecloud.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pestilence</span></a>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="st-priority">ST Priority Blood Death Knight DPS</h3>
<ol>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Maintain your diseases at all times</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55262/heart-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart Strike</span></a> if you have a Blood or Death Rune active</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=49924/death-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_deathknight_butcher2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death Strike</span></a> if you have a Frost and Unholy Rune active</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=62904/death-coil">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_deathcoil.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death Coil</span></a> to spend RP, <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=56815/rune-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_deathknight_darkconviction.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rune Strike</span></a> if you can.</div></li></ol>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="aoe-priority">AOE  Priority Blood Death Knight DPS</h3>
<ol>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Maintain your diseases at all times</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55262/heart-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart Strike</span></a> if you have a Blood or Death Rune active on 4 or less targets.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=49941/blood-boil">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_deathknight_bloodboil.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blood Boil</span></a> if you have a Blood or Death Rune active on 5 or more targets.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=49938/death-and-decay">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_deathanddecay.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death and Decay</span></a> on 8 or more targets.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=49924/death-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_deathknight_butcher2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death Strike</span></a> if you have a Frost and Unholy Rune active</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=62904/death-coil">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_deathcoil.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death Coil</span></a> to spend RP, <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=56815/rune-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_deathknight_darkconviction.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rune Strike</span></a> if you can.</div></li></ol>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="cooldowns">Cooldowns for Blood Death Knight DPS</h3>
<div class="box">
<h5 class="heading-size-5 first last" id="dancing-rune-weapon">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=49028/dancing-rune-weapon">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_07.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dancing Rune Weapon</span></a></h5></div>Dancing Rune Weapon is your big cooldown, and improper use of it will show in your damage. This ability can be snapshotted with pretty much everything but Armor Penetration. So making sure its cast when you have all of your haste increased, and damage increases will lead to more effective DRW windows. This means using Unholy Frenzy on yourself, and paying a Rogue to give you Tricks before cast.<div class="box">
<h5 class="heading-size-5 first last" id="unholy-frenzy">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=49016/unholy-frenzy">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_deathknight_bladedarmor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unholy Frenzy</span></a></h5></div>A flat 20% damage increase on a 3 minute cooldown means you'll be using this with every other Dancing Rune Weapon, and Raise Dead. Make sure to snapshot this by using it before DRW.<div class="box">
<h5 class="heading-size-5 first last" id="raise-dead">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=46584/raise-dead">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_animatedead.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Raise Dead</span></a></h5></div>A decent DPS increase, you'll want to use this after popping all of your haste abilities to ensure the most damage possible. <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55623/night-of-the-dead">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_deathknight_armyofthedead.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Night of the Dead</span></a> turns this 3 minute cooldown to a 1.5 minute cooldown, meaning you'll be using it every DRW window with your other cooldowns. It also reduces the aoe damage taken by 90%, which will actually keep it alive.<div class="box">
<h5 class="heading-size-5 first last" id="army-of-the-dead">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=42650/army-of-the-dead">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_deathknight_armyofthedead.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Army of the Dead</span></a></h5></div>As Blood it's not worth it to snapshot army as you'll lose ability usage during your DRW window. It's best to use during pre-pull for a little extra damage.<div class="box">
<h5 class="heading-size-5 first last" id="icebound-fortitude">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=48792/icebound-fortitude">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_deathknight_iceboundfortitude.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Icebound Fortitude</span></a></h5></div>Our only damage reduction cooldown, a flat 30% Damage Reduction with extra based on how much Defense you have for 12 seconds.<div class="box">
<h5 class="heading-size-5 first last" id="empower-rune-weapon">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47568/empower-rune-weapon">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_62.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Empower Rune Weapon</span></a></h5></div>Empower Rune Weapon is a huge cooldown is an amazing ability, resetting all of your runes immediately. You'll  really use this in the opener to set-up a huge first DRW window easily.<div class="box">
<h5 class="heading-size-5 first last" id="anti-magic-shell">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=48707/anti-magic-shell">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_antimagicshell.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Anti-Magic Shell</span></a></h5></div>Anti-Magic Shell while a defensive cooldown, is also an offensive one. Learning what boss abilities you can take advantage of to gain max Runic Power will reduce your dps downtime. Think soaking fire damage with it between Mimiron phases to shoot off Death Coil's as the boss is spawned.<div class="box">
<h5 class="heading-size-5 first last" id="blood-tap">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=45529/blood-tap">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_deathknight_bloodtap.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blood Tap</span></a></h5></div>This ability turns one of your Blood Runes into a Death rune for 20 seconds, on a 1 minute cooldown. The cooldown starts immediately on use, so really this equates to a 40 second downtime. While Death Runes made by <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=54637/blood-of-the-north">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_79.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blood of the North</span></a> do not have a a set timer, this ability does give you one.</div>